# 04 · push-to-talk. In worker.go you hold Alt-t and ask aloud (the stage plays the question into the recorder);
# the meter moves under your line, you let go, whisper.cpp writes down what it heard, and Pair answers in its place.
Output out/push-to-talk.mp4
Source tapes/head.tape
Hide
Type "cd $CAP/hookd && clear && nvim -i NONE --listen $CAP/nvim.sock -u $CAP_HERE/init.lua +31 internal/delivery/worker.go"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type ":echo"
Enter
Type "zz"
Sleep 300ms
Show
Sleep 1.2s
